<title>USA: Greenfield, Mass., won by Bank of Boston.</title>
<headline>Greenfield, Mass., won by Bank of Boston.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of Boston said it won $4.636</p>
<p>million of Greenfield, Mass., various general obligation bonds,</p>
<p>with a true interest cost of 4.9621 percent.</p>
</text>
